{"id":"fa7a47e0464f94a4","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-truth-theory-development.md","title":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的历史记录","display":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的历史记录","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-truth-theory-development","aliases":["91-fact-truth-theory-development","91-fact-theory-history","91-fact-truth-theory-evolution"],"display":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的历史记录","depends_on":["[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-truth-theory-development"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-truth-theory-development</span><span>91-fact-theory-history</span><span>91-fact-truth-theory-evolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-truth-theory-development — 真理理论机制的历史记录"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}\\)</span> 是方案标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\\)</span> 为机制标签。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Method}\">\\(\\operatorname{Method}\\)</span> 是下述本地记录函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Earlier}\">\\(\\operatorname{Earlier}\\)</span> 采用出版年份的严格小于关系，所涉记录为 Tarski 1935、Kripke 1975。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Method}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Hierarchy}),(\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{SKFix}),\n(\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}),(\\mathsf{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\\Longleftrightarrow1935&lt;1975.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Method}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Hierarchy}),(\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{SKFix}),\n(\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}),(\\mathsf{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\\Longleftrightarrow1935&lt;1975.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Method 现在作为有限记录明确给定，避免对一个任意、未约束函数断言等式。这只记录各方案的核心机制，不把先后顺序当作逻辑蕴涵或强度链。\nTarski 的元语言定义、Kripke 的部分固定点、Friedman–Sheard 的真理规则及 Cantini 的超赋值公理，是不同的研究路线。具体算术比较应另用强度定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 3、Chapters 14–15、第 18 章；Bibliography 的 Tarski 1935、Kripke 1975 条目。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Hierarchy},\\mathsf{SKFix},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Method}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Earlier}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}development}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Method}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Hierarchy}),(\\mathsf{Kripke},\\mathsf{SKFix}),\n(\\mathsf{FS},\\mathsf{CaptureRelease}),(\\mathsf{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Earlier}(\\mathsf{Tarski},\\mathsf{Kripke})\\Longleftrightarrow1935<1975.","display":true}],"bytes":1741,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-development]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-211","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-development]]"}],"outgoing":["8f93c57db760a2b7","ae9eced0b12cbd2a","25c37fe51095276d","669ee474b9646a38"]}